{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16793","headline":"奉和登玄武楼观射即事书怀赐孟涉应制 · 崔元翰","name":"奉和登玄武楼观射即事书怀赐孟涉应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宁岁常有备，殊方靡不宾。\n禁营列武卫，帝座彰威神。\n讲事一临幸，加恩徧抚巡。\n城高凤楼耸，塲逈兽侯新。\n饮羽连百中，控弦踰六钧。\n拣材尽爪士，受任皆信臣。\n光赏文藻丽，便繁心膂亲。\n复如观太清，昭烂垂芳辰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔元翰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16793.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16793","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}